.	http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/ecce:annotation		ORCA, PBE0-D3BJ/def2-SVP, optimisation and analytic frequencies with IR and Raman. This calculation shows the C=O stretch of an ester at 1889.67 cm-1 (unscaled), with IR 256.88 km/mol and Raman activity 3.413: the ester bands are stronger in IR and weaker in Raman than those of formaldehyde, acetaldehyde and acetone in this set.
